            "summary": "Earlier this week, Esperion Therapeutics completed a follow-on public offering of 30,000,000 shares of its common stock at US$2.50 per share, raising total gross proceeds of approximately US$75 million to fund ongoing development and commercialization initiatives. This capital raise occurs alongside a settlement with Dr. Reddy\u2019s Laboratories that prevents generic competition for Esperion\u2019s cholesterol drugs in the U.S. until April 2040, providing more certainty around future revenue streams...",
